      "updated": 1788152192640,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "celery architecture:\n\n                 ┌──────────────┐\n                 │   FastAPI    │\n                 │              │\nUser Request ───►│ Create Job   │\n                 └──────┬───────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 ┌──────────────┐\n                 │ Message Queue│\n                 │ RabbitMQ     │\n                 │ Redis        │\n                 └──────┬───────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n              ┌───────────────────┐\n              │   Celery Workers  │\n              │                   │\n              │ Worker 1          │\n              │ Worker 2          │\n              │ Worker 3          │\n              └───────────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 Process Document",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "celery architecture:\n\n                 ┌──────────────┐\n                 │   FastAPI    │\n                 │              │\nUser Request ───►│ Create Job   │\n                 └──────┬───────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 ┌──────────────┐\n                 │ Message Queue│\n                 │ RabbitMQ     │\n                 │ Redis        │\n                 └──────┬───────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n              ┌───────────────────┐\n              │   Celery Workers  │\n              │                   │\n              │ Worker 1          │\n              │ Worker 2          │\n              │ Worker 3          │\n              └───────────────────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                 Process Document",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
