    {
      "id": "He3SMKpgCeSoRdLdzI91U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -235.26088929051843,
      "y": 3599.0622103463293,
      "width": 566.4702758789062,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "al",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1004088308,
      "version": 38,
      "versionNonce": 705454964,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788155342404,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your FastAPI application sends a task\nmessage to RabbitMQ, and Celery\nworkers consume that task message from\nRabbitMQ.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your FastAPI application sends a task message to RabbitMQ, and Celery workers consume that task message from RabbitMQ.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1ZFNnwOwGAghFP3j4h-B9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 934.253518150163,
      "y": 580.5677504968983,
      "width": 370.8423592328912,
      "height": 58.16592637052735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1346584698,
      "version": 139,
      "versionNonce": 1690172538,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788420015691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Why def (synchronous) is ideal\nhere:",
      "fontSize": 23.266370548210944,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Why def (synchronous) is ideal here:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ASigW7p5MSDz09zGkGawZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 942.4092525465733,
      "y": 665.5901626821426,
      "width": 381.7775107885535,
      "height": 174.49777911158208,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 954899494,
      "version": 265,
      "versionNonce": 1424236710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788420027430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronous Database\nOperations: Standard SQLAlchemy\n(db.query(...), db.commit()) uses\nblocking I/O (it waits for\nPostgreSQL over network\nsockets).",
      "fontSize": 23.266370548210944,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Synchronous Database Operations: Standard SQLAlchemy (db.query(...), db.commit()) uses blocking I/O (it waits for PostgreSQL over network sockets).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GhB3RhRdDJYJ2K4zSs1ye",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 952.7401207404516,
      "y": 881.4450067204917,
      "width": 390.3162290178832,
      "height": 232.6637054821094,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 364454202,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 531557734,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788420025324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FastAPI Thread Pool Execution:\nWhen an endpoint is declared as\ndef (without async), FastAPI\nautomatically runs it in a separate\nthread pool (anyio threadpool).\nThis prevents your database\nquery from blocking FastAPI's\nmain event loop!",
      "fontSize": 23.266370548210944,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FastAPI Thread Pool Execution: When an endpoint is declared as def (without async), FastAPI automatically runs it in a separate thread pool (anyio threadpool). This prevents your database query from blocking FastAPI's main event loop!",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
